  "notes": "FORMS:\n⟦{蹴|け}る→蹴る：02054_keru⟧ (to kick) + ⟦{落|お}とす→落とす：01246_otosu⟧ (to drop, knock down)\n\nVERB \n\nGodan verb with す ending\n- {蹴落|けお}とす (dictionary form)\n- {蹴落|けお}として (te-form)\n- {蹴落|けお}とされる (passive)\n\nUSAGE:\nSense 2 is common in competitive contexts (business, politics, sports) and often carries negative connotations of ruthless competition or unethical behavior.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{蹴|け}る→蹴る：02054_keru⟧: to kick\n- ⟦{落|お}とす→落とす：01246_otosu⟧: to drop, knock down\n- ⟦{追|お}い{落|お}とす→追い落とす：18717_oiotosu⟧: to oust, drive out\n- ⟦{押|お}しのける→押しのける：15778_oshinokeru⟧: to push aside",
